# Core Proxy Sync Rule

When any admin feature starts consuming, changing, or removing a core API call:

1. Update `docs/contracts/consumer-core-mapping.md`.
2. Ensure the method/path/status expectations match the current core OpenAPI/contract source.
3. Update affected module docs in `docs/modules/*`.
4. Update tests relevant to parsing, error handling, and authorization headers.

Do not complete API proxy work while mapping documentation is outdated.
